"""Shared pipeline core for the 10.8x dynamic-SEP analyses.

Introduced by the 10.8f review response (notes/REQUEST10_8F_REVIEW_RESPONSE.md):
C1  one CAUSAL template implementation (col_s is the +pi/2 = -sin drive
